{
  "$schema": "../../../../../schemas/model.schema.json",
  "_comment": [
    "HAND-AUTHORED and NOT generated. A virtual type like MyAccountRow: no clrType, no documents. The rows of the",
    "dependency onboarding page (/dependency-updates/onboard, dependency-updates PRD R22, D-O14) are computed per request",
    "and per viewer by Custom.DependencyOnboardingRows (DependencyOnboardingRowActions -> IDependencyOnboardingService),",
    "from the repositories the viewer manages, narrowed by the parent DependencyOnboardingScope (the setup redirect's query).",
    "",
    "Each row's id is the Repository document id, which is what the query action EnableDependencyUpdates takes: the",
    "framework re-runs this query narrowed to the selected ids, so a repository the viewer does not manage cannot even be",
    "selected (the action refuses the whole request), and the action re-checks every row that is (R21).",
    "",
    "The status columns are text the server translated, so the framework's search and sort work on what the user reads.",
    "Only Query is granted on this type (security.json), never Read: the rows have no detail page. The row link is the",
    "page's rowRoute, to the repository's own page."
  ],
